From 3af00b6775acf1f2623b834e2825335e9e335178 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:15:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] STO-1044: restyle Account settings as the cream menu card
 with autosave

The Account sheet becomes the login form's cream menu card, sliding up over the
dimmed street with the HUD above it. Every change saves on its own and a felt
tag confirms it, so Save and Cancel are gone; DONE closes the sheet.

- Display name reuses the login Field and saves on blur, Return or DONE.
  Empty and over-16 names show an error and never save (16 is a placeholder).
- Sign-in panel: Email shows SIGNED IN; Game Center, Google and Apple go
  LINK -> LINKING... -> LINKED with the linked caption.
- Notifications use a gold toggle with a switch role and label, saving on tap.
- Delete account moves to a red link at the bottom. Its red panel needs DELETE
  typed (plus the password for email accounts) and runs the STO-821 flow.
- The HUD avatar and the sheet show session.user.image when set, ready for
  avatar upload (STO-1050).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
